om/v/t64.5771-25/499619808_1182381367083581_8403279582652785227_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eD4-VMXcHEIQ7kNvwHe8Xz3&_nc_oc=AdmExuN2pyEgppmrA4Xc665LXZkYKTxzarXZX3RJ7TZ4mLztpPj4zFgEKSI4OyvwX9E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsmXAiYE7-yDb6vguZwm_UsSfi3nHWiaJLMv0dZ7vteyA&oe=699DADED"}, {"file_name": "StoryMode.png", "id": "32811313745133632", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618297_32811313751800298_6861778986600558374_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-OH0Iq2m9H4Q7kNvwEz7uQG&_nc_oc=AdkoudChnOXaHKE8zmv6s-uXaLQP0AC-i8WSw4qJV-ms2hr-vYu_Lfv-qAnvsVBDLhk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afv61QCxYN3R2iVeVUq8-qh0sKQGUybxMWVZHgtubNFuiA&oe=699DAE37"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "GameThumbnail.png", "id": "864108156302774", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619685_864108159636107_8140054702670079169_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xaZhqWxIddcQ7kNvwGQTDHB&_nc_oc=AdlVBYddKh5N1QGK27txU36ETViZsk8U-oCAUbQVIHSPzXqBCRLE1NQe-yKbZ3iwZxU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvOeHOZ2T7FjTywer2D3PUil29aS4jNtqGsaacfrSuNeg&oe=699D862C"}, "display_name": "Novalight", "keywords": ["Story", "Gamemodes", "Space", "Robots", "Adventure"], "long_description": "# Welcome to Novalight!\n\nNovalight is a free-to-play, hand-based movement multiplayer game that takes place thousands of years into the future where humans have gone extinct after a failed experiment caused the earth to explode.\n\n{2872839186238379}\n\n# Choose Your Own Path:\n\nJoin up to **20 players** in a public server or create a private one with friends!\n\nPlay through either the **Story Mode, Gamemodes** or perhaps just hangout & chat with friends in the lobby.\n\n{2244974466007548}\n\n# Customization:\n\nYou can customize your character with a wide variety of cosmetics!\n\nand may purchase them with **Nebulite** in the store!\nth